{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1195,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f64a2730718b2fcd7f5b02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在可以开始跑了吗？\n我的脚已经躁动不安了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe66a3f61f1aa4f9c1d45cbfabdf0c30cfc3f595ccb5467a661511b53a5e7f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd690115b1c7949a16e4e7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得身体好轻盈……！\n快点开始训练吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c604c3e50f90a5128965052e0ef829adc59458b28d0be05b243f46c6defcd7c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a62a9acdaa882fe22620d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好清爽的风……\n在这阵风里面奔跑，\n好像会很舒服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "949124a6939ebdc8b280135e969a19f060667addfcf9951b79e896d75a37d4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1266e624bcab29ebc2ada22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天会跑怎样的路线呢……\n我很期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ce9edcc7f5574c06381abe4f8f04d032ca0368d73b3cd85fc001489a47ab32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc4d18e45095ef1ab5402f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经做好准备运动了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5a8dad2353c748c325dd93cb5893876139158107e95283196591f522926c80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de9a235009bdbed5bf891e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要怎么做呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f670d2aac65370fe9f671b9d69bd84a5e3772cba47e2f3711f73b482d00609ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252fb6916eb4dc9039668a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体的动作很奇怪……？\n……啊不，没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61152b83fd935e077f02073b1cfa775a6f78d53e484fa8689f08026c64e8c8b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebab373722279a59bd6d9f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么回事，脚好沉重……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b612eae58e6e7332c76455a20d3765fd0ce183d0faaf091651612d2feb43db91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67cd14d08fe65ff6272b2f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没法发挥平时的实力…\n为什么呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5fdea96c3a083b24c8ed726f69d8dcadb592b2488d6fb91fc9f76cd001a7450",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567e4711cfeb864651c3ce13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体使不上劲……！\n这种事情……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "684723be2dda227a3d796eb3143e35534a846e5c1666ee22ae3b6fba6a0e08f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a90567ad246a045303dc59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很想继续奔跑，\n但也不能把身体跑坏……\n…好难把控奔跑的量啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb46352630376e387436e3cbe9cc698d5c9e50636af0da9a7de94c5ae9467917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff294ba444e3de1f2fceb8b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还想继续参加比赛……\n但这样下去的话……身体会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "747ff5abdc89b850ce2251a6391e7b4cbc5652c63ae439257cdfa4146cdc728e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f7bf4286250016d30b63ce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，脚很轻盈呢……！\n让我有种马上就跑起来的冲动呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8a5782368233c41eff4798d711e1968ee41b8997f25a880feedcac43f20c0bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b91bc1c9cf6099f599a69f63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛也很有意思！\n能早点开始吗……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d533bc9d012e57ec0488796f312c75a4615327921f01a629684ad8aa9ad4ac80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838d23723a43c03f6cf98d30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最前方的景色……\n我一定要亲眼见证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ab565c4c3ff26e3f9d3d24d6cf00089958aec75f35c0671892acc3313aafdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83da0e691261e51c83953a22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得是场不错的比赛。\n比赛果然很开心啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5924f0fe433d40a8e5133e8a5452cb7dea1c4e93a02c61b8d40a67cecbf5fa78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091d3fe83d26ac6e66c27661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态感觉不错。\n为了这一天，\n我一直在调整。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00fe740538003ae69b9fa3f595a723c51c85dfbb3a1666d55962c98b731c994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6186f304298b2bd8e6694cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天，\n又能看见怎样的景色呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacd68f81403f9e5f6a7e9a39e052768821383e17e88b96446528dca21e5a2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341bfae616066dd62132195a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有问题。\n能发挥和往常一样的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eabae70dab0ac641d9f5f1da5e586d2640bbda0f241517b587c6922cf3d6e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f680cee25616e9c221c8df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迄今为止学到的一切，\n都会在这场比赛中发挥出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38751120d6747400ff9dba1a1d82a7d738287f8348f0b8a4db0ac68a58672be8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e016f1614433b80bbb76c97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请好好看着我。\n我一定会赢给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b280392f9f277549d9f1f76f48c5d2834568cc2f8c8245c11bc030f58bdf0fcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75912a4631834366c0481c87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然稍微有点不安……\n不过没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61f38312eaf489c1683a472038fc3525d68b27d4f26eec0c7bdc6a6fb4988388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4772524af0e1b4710b3b6ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要回想起平时的训练……\n只要按平时那样来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "887568dc1b764983de26d00b74e1c3ff69c6c2bacc15e1960ebe454f54052bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021114f4cc48e27157898239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只会向着前方奔跑……\n除此以外的事情，我从没考虑过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8f4040d2ad629ec8464fc78c6213dd9adcefff800c301afeabefa3e7a3ab23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e7a8e3edb9c4b49a45e05de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像状态调整得不太好…\n不过，即便说出来，\n也没什么用吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c863e806b3c6549a916b6a1412d1e3b33a6177686dfa5c68d9368316bfae7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e778d134578b8950e0b1639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会想想办法得。\n……我能做的事情，也只有这些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16bc1dfb120b5f2a3b50bc9febac7e4bcfc495c69b120ad2c29fccada82f1a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e0ad8c0bc380fe1c295f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果不好好想想在这个状态也能获胜得方法的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "006293882dec5fa052ebf302c496286e2f63fa4c6496d9eb354c5b2e8f349be0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd506f827fd3cc9447d3bc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc3e66bd2d16801a26318a428d92c7d296744eed798b5374b62953d95ec7a1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1138dc1bca0e756e68106c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样做吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5799ad0f672a660391192cba4dd913ba436f4b0efed2cee88a69e29b7ecbc00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c23a0efd8802881a4510313a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "699db54a6070f6537ee1817b4c40d18c535ad7b4e2e0cc73bab6aee991c73bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f47a53b36f3adcffdc1bf28c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1e04ca0fa6cabf572aaedefcfd9e13cbbafaadb54df1396aaf088b0b4eafbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1460064f135ab939bb31722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎、哎呀……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "560a0492be676c1b24181eaa4452afd12d0062c5b272cf4eb801cbe16bc816e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3081b32f27f801d33c9f535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3023a0f6bbd7d6c413875a60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb0d881cd80a16baae5d41c1d7268ab2194b50e1175597b0547df0c45d47e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f014f17c3adddbad1f99979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9133036f52dcf86c128edfc66a74cea96e5a7dfd6551d57f58ca410d74eb1cdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08134e2205dddf40f2339465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实是比以前更快了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f5bd6f7edad7a5117db46d0089d6e110615e49144c95eb9cbc50d8605764c46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b86bafa3d68433dd22c9122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d420c190cbe7837f3b9b3b57e9405d6ae686a7ee46a6f65a56a0ef95e170b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbc918971ff7bd3803d2d77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd979ec5c1d2eae7bacb3fcf4678aa757f130dbcbdad16c6299a5514b0451aad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2355aadc1b50591d4819d395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才不会输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56891a3fffb316b06e2286c1fbe5382dea197a33e6ed62e8092cc1228a12c699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db61ae5a68dafc8e87743a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，要加油哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58f9e902eaf95032f1e31f9ef27d189616cd58c094d96c2f5989b5d3014577c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091d64c638f5da4b29acf38f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d420c190cbe7837f3b9b3b57e9405d6ae686a7ee46a6f65a56a0ef95e170b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8feacc75333f2df46acfc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天又会见识到\r\n怎样的景色呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89d7d8a59cb3215e1ad164047d03383a7dfdcbb3818193095baeacde6e15275",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e5e11f8d9710591b268b63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最前方的景色……\r\n必定要用我的双眼来见证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8fa141b5f39c729eb12adb4a3c671c465097d43b994d65c8048278b94a49f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63efe5a0f1cdfff02c40a676",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d420c190cbe7837f3b9b3b57e9405d6ae686a7ee46a6f65a56a0ef95e170b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7ca3775e12a96a3a819cd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab98623c2ea24062f92dc78d2ab4feff44b3929c7e6e5b4d53cc2cf1f89b8bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7171ceec11248392395453d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明只差一点了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e316601eec41f45b0099f71406dfbaed86826a44779e64cf3ec6a5c8231aafc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca73301e44cfbecb1505d478",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还不错……但感觉还不够。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adb3e976fe772d341b470a8d382d28f6497165d5b581d17597ff798b0bc84dc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e0946a9bb2b9ad7618fc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可不能就此满足……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6014db7e2ed7a53b25343eb1ef100716477b5c01ed8a77c25170e3bfc7773309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a94a54229e5b5d691ef9fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……下次会拿出好结果的。一定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03c9762915b216e5f3cb34ef7d09544b34a6999aa26df09d071f844721119d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ee99fe2293f3adbd84a0f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……只属于我的景色……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6b718a7d18825314f5a9812c84f5d13d8b4b4406fbabc6cc253d9743c97c0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b82edf7529b80108cfbf62a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，真舒服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b0c7da922fc352af4fa291f0e918456e97afa6cbb1dbfec4335c6498940af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ec6afdd9422506905f44a68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "景色就像逐渐染上色彩一般……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143c62a15f3efce85773fa6314b427f6ed697b043f61110f3ffc05ccd9114655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f58dc012e128ac3c46da792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，真舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ace174110ef76dc2e79798924bb09d45050670e9299e1707630cdb0599b10418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a9b9f1953eee0865c1f897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备要冲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "239024480552b74db34ff940e11a8c8a031b9ac4a139b49d5090deaa28bc7bfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a84378a4adc41b3c482547d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于看见了……这就是只属于我的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b306c18b2bd86450386255e1d2a32c7e12706dc7a302ba54bf9f7d9fbde62cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fa40af0ca472e6c6d0d1143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开朝会、当配膳值日生……\r\n泡澡的时间也很零碎。唔，看来\r\n今天也没办法尽情奔跑了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "826f45ef83a09e6320cb6f8ff9a461d87eebebf9f5e36ef0f66d65167d8890bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33661205ec5f179c0b69b18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上起床就立刻\r\n跟许多人见面的生活……\r\n嗯，是不是稍微习惯一点了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "910ce0d6122dca1f04371a274b6c3ddb44862022447c4e6d29660a8d5c86d28d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c676a1bd709e30c7a6bdd9ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽掉到海里时\r\n看起来真的吓了一大跳……\r\n……呵呵。嗯，真开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea48e577a4dd3f528a0568ef19ab4f9dfb77af7e2114548c7ad525a10fb0b9b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90641746b139172f4c329622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……终于看见了！\n在超越速度的极限之后…无论哪儿都如此祥静美好的景色…\n我曾见过的景色…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2489c73bf3857aecacfb58282ef6e3a704f3fce82a2b9b71ee9f1b855d7ee47c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc81cc64cc6c45872b6db5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家在那片炎热的沙滩上\r\n有说有笑的模样……\r\n依然留在我脑中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95259d45c0c9ea7876ecadab5228029bcb60fcccd09f080cd52850031919851b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3919598f77fe51e6e8da0ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从来没有想过……\r\n我竟然会感到有点寂寞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6618f90a55aa202dca90bf08a9e41734a76439b2d1c7c2a52ce1cca8c1975556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7a9b501e637bc8af6537c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向前迈进，\r\n把大海和星空都抛在身后……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec88b67080f105134ad1b36272f8e0e49c1a4da217ecd0e50633edc8539462b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2024237e5ae4bcb095a8d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无人的天空、海洋，以及──\r\n呵呵呵……！绵延无尽的……道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63c3bfe48341d5f3d68ca76d0c9e2e73d25040149092d1e1c84752e18a720760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf9b0244efa22d01cd3a953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉比比赛还要紧张呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "956167822fecc0236672c09723352705aa745fad4274c036d25f0d6eb29e8613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:561cd1ff92711d3a78c67357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc101fd9e7eac4e0ac233dc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要冲了哦，大家一起……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d53b53f98b0082647cf53a7dcc7ce3051a8a13671a4bf159b43d9ed5c602f08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe909c6794aa85f42c58b244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与训练员一起看见的景色\n今后我也一定不会忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d01a1594471b06b7688197508b030caac1d53a1fd59f25820b5764c754ed427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c5aaa4d87fce3c843b39284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件制服也穿得很习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f0abc236839d30327f649d7d65523d1007ce63b1dcc28c4eb6f032044d09019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722c4755db7722d1c1c70de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微有点……害羞呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aaf2c5462be8d2c1011486630ebc601b2fd390d47a3dfe10cd93a0a0fc4b24c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a4e66dcde30d81ae6be2fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都快、比任何人都更靠前……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3f1356d90814ea43e5fe0fb1d5f798d177f9fcc7782c1a15d592e335a5a0f30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a6a91db817e42acf2dadb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然偶尔也会闹过头……但还是很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e626ba33aeb5205bb779388ba755a3ef58487a3b5c73bcf84add4a1b12c0112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d63bc171628d5c0c1446c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要露出笑脸边唱边跳……Live，真难呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5427917510ecab35c9ff1a91b1912354678254744a47121f6ffce722328171b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43577e25b097b050a1402a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "见识过各种各样的景色了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19cdc206d79f397a4d74682dfdcc490818ebf85a982ee4a4885f2788e865091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d38f0ee95cbde479fffb81bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……非常凉快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b5c0ed699ab396491390853511d1d782cf81d535ca10ccd0e5ec2a73323163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc64a7bfa57c0131c61b0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像海洋的颜色一样，真棒呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d62850ff57a992a97f25b4d8f6780a340aafc0df8d3b7ad858463b3c9dfebee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394276955fb55045a3c422c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "882c61f943b29ccffcc7cff6723ee11ec25d00aa5e2bbb7ac7cc7e52f7e2321b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf2f2bcde377f2ecf6a2a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最前方的景色，我绝不拱手相让……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f6391790f26c18f80ec087798462582dfa51058fb5c9ec48bcb3f8b59a6d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43d571aaa8496dad291bf23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上喜欢的衣服后，\r\n看见的景色也会不尽相同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be0969be1df21827cd9faa624ff965727575f060fc57fc1dd5db7a83d3bf1c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f6c47d09ede2f59bc2ca94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条项链是父母送我的入学礼物哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3289fd41368ffbda0f2d1195d662b939d9d99064ddf3241f8c57b52fa8950fbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653161f686173ccc81cd2d6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件制服也穿得很习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f0abc236839d30327f649d7d65523d1007ce63b1dcc28c4eb6f032044d09019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
